4 on substrates with rising moisture.","heading":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS","s":{"t":"PDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/e/sikafloor_multiduret-14.pdf","v":"April 2023, Version 03.05","p":3,"pe":3,"sec":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS"},"pm":[]},{"id":"sikafloor-multiduret-14:restriction:2c4178d0","type":"restriction","pol":"no","cond":true,"tags":{},"text":"If heating is required do not use gas, oil, paraffin or other fossil fuel heaters, these produce large quantities of both CO2 and H2O water vapour, which may adversely affect the finish","heading":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS","s":{"t":"PDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/e/sikafloor_multiduret-14.pdf","v":"April 2023, Version 03.05","p":3,"pe":3,"sec":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS"},"pm":[]},{"id":"sikafloor-multiduret-14:compatibility:23f900ef","type":"compatibility","pol":"yes","cond":false,"tags":{"substrate":["metal"]},"text":"Note: Addition of 60 or 80 mesh aluminium oxide incorporated into the final coat at 5-6%vol will produce additional texture","heading":"System information > System structure","s":{"t":"PDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/e/sikafloor_multiduret-14.pdf","v":"April 2023, Version 03.05","p":2,"pe":2,"sec":"System information > System structure"},"pm":[]}],"sf":{"status":"not published","sds":[]},"sp":{"ds":{"url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/e/sikafloor_multiduret-14.pdf","title":"Sikafloor® MultiDur ET-14","edition":"April 2023, Version 03.05","version":"03.05","issued":"April 2023"},"std":[{"citation":"AS 4586-2013","section":"APPROVALS / CERTIFICATES","page":1,"context":"Textures - Conforms to AS 4586-2013 P Ratings"},{"citation":"ASTM D3960","section":"APPROVALS / CERTIFICATES","page":1,"context":"VOC - Australian Standards ASTM D3960 Gren Star Building Council V2 IEQ-13 V1 IEQ-11"},{"citation":"DIN 51130","section":"APPROVALS / CERTIFICATES","page":1,"context":"Slip resistance class R9 in accordance with DIN 51130 and BGR 181."},{"cit